Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Close elliptical holes at their minor semi-axis in the
 corpus

The elliptical hole witness covers nonrational parallels with swallowtails
and records the open critical-curvature cusp case.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
